      "revision": {
        "title": "Artikllar: a, an, the",
        "description": "a/an — noaniq; the — aniq (ma'lum) ot oldida.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nInglizchada sanaladigan ot oldida ko'pincha **artikl** turadi: **a**, **an** yoki **the**. O'zbekchada bunday so'z yo'q, shuning uchun uni alohida o'rganamiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Artikl | Qachon | Misol |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **a** | undosh **tovush** bilan boshlanadigan ot | a **b**ook, a **c**ar, a **u**niversity (yu-) |\n| **an** | unli **tovush** bilan boshlanadigan ot | an **a**pple, an **e**gg, an **h**our (soat — h o'qilmaydi) |\n| **the** | tinglovchiga **ma'lum**, aniq narsa | **the** sun, Open **the** door. |\n\n**Muhim:** tanlov harfga emas, **tovush**ga qarab bo'ladi: *an hour* (h jim), *a university* (yu- undosh kabi)." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- I have **a** book and **an** apple.\n- She is **a** teacher.\n- Please close **the** window.\n- **The** moon is beautiful tonight.\n- He is **an** engineer." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-ARTICLES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I eat ___ apple every morning.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "a" }, { "id": "b", "text": "an" }, { "id": "c", "text": "the" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Unli tovush oldida **a** emas, **an** ishlating; artiklni butunlay tushirib qoldirmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *I have a egg.* → To'g'ri: **I have an egg.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *She is teacher.* → To'g'ri: **She is a teacher.**" }
          },
          {
