        "title": "Otlarning ko'plik shakli",
        "description": "-s / -es; y → -ies; qoidasiz ko'pliklar (children, men, women).",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBir dona narsa — **birlik** (one book). Bir nechta narsa — **ko'plik** (three books). Bu darsda otni ko'plikka aylantirishni o'rganamiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Holat | Qoida | Misol |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Oddiy ot | + **s** | book → book**s**, car → car**s** |\n| -s, -x, -ch, -sh, -o | + **es** | box → box**es**, watch → watch**es** |\n| undosh + **y** | y → **ies** | city → cit**ies**, baby → bab**ies** |\n\n## Qoidasiz (yod olinadi)\n- man → **men**, woman → **women**\n- child → **children**, person → **people**\n- foot → **feet**, tooth → **teeth**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- one book → two **books**\n- one box → three **boxes**\n- one city → many **cities**\n- one child → four **children**\n- one man → two **men**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PLURALS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Ko'plik shakli: 'box'", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "boxs" }, { "id": "b", "text": "boxes" }, { "id": "c", "text": "boxies" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Qoidasiz otlarga **-s** qo'shmang; -ch/-sh/-x dan keyin **-es** ni unutmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *three childs* → To'g'ri: **three children**\n> Noto'g'ri: *two watchs* → To'g'ri: **two watches**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PLURALS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Ko'plik shakli: 'city'", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "citys" }, { "id": "b", "text": "cityes" }, { "id": "c", "text": "cities" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["c"] } }
          },
